// Ch2 Cutscene A, "The Girl on the Beach". Beat B01 in docs/kb/story/beats/vertical_slice.md.
// Facial beat to hit (H06): Asha's smile, the half-beat stillness at the lantern, then the smile again.
// Grade: color script `ch02` (dawn, 06:20). Shots: docs/kb/art/environments/haluna.md §5.1.
// Camera grammar (decisions_log N-13): H05, H06 and H01 are unrelated setups, so every change is a
// cut (blend=0.0). The cut to H01 lands on the walk, after Asha's last line on H05.
// H05 is Rhen's POV and follows his eye: lying, sitting, or standing in the "Get up" branch (N-17).
// The human's playtest (2026-10-28): H05 and H06 are now low two-shots from the sea side that hold both
// faces (his on the sand, hers above him), not his POV.
// Light rule: the motes that came ashore with Rhen are HELD (glimmer_held: cool cyan, drifting
// sideways and down toward the water). Nothing rises in this scene. The first rising light is Ch3.
// Asha's stillness is recognition of the make: at seven she saw this lantern's twin on the stranger
// who brought her mother's comb home (ADR 0022, sweep-H). She never says so. It burns oil.
title: ch02_girl_on_the_beach
location: ch02/haluna
grade: ch02
---
@letterbox on
@camera H05
// M2-FP-103: he is down in the shallows when the scene opens (lie_in_shallows is on Character's list;
// until it is built sequencer.json clip_stand_ins kneels him, half risen, rather than standing him up).
@anim rhen lie_in_shallows
// M2-FP-103: she is already kneeling over him when the dawn fades in (the clip settles under the black).
// The human's playtest: she kneels at his left side, turned in toward his head and shoulders (across
// his body, not alongside it), leaning over him with a hand at his back and her eyes down on his face,
// which lies cheek to the sand on the sea side. haluna.tscn stages them up the beach where the wash is
// only a film (Spawns/Beach, Actors/asha), and H05 and H06 look in from the sea at both faces.
@anim asha kneel_over_rhen
@music haluna_dawn fade=4.0
@fade in 2.5
The sea gave me back at dawn. Somebody was humming. #line:ch02_beach_001 #vo
A star-path. The one they teach children for finding the way home. #line:ch02_beach_016 #vo
@face asha soft_smile 0.6
Asha [soft_smile]: There you are. No, don't sit up yet. You've swallowed half the bay. #line:ch02_beach_002
@camera H06 blend=0.0
@anim toma spear_level
Toma [determined]: Lie still, please, and keep your hands open. I would like this to stay a small conversation. #line:ch02_beach_003
Rhen [afraid]: That's a very big spear for a very small conversation. #line:ch02_beach_004
@anim asha laugh
Asha [laugh]: Toma. He's half drowned. I think he's allowed one joke. #line:ch02_beach_005
Toma [neutral]: One. #line:ch02_beach_017
@anim asha look_at rhen_lantern
@face asha neutral 0.2
@wait 0.6
Asha [neutral]: That lantern. #line:ch02_beach_006
@wait 0.6
@face asha soft_smile 0.8
Asha [soft_smile]: Where did you get it? #line:ch02_beach_007
-> It was my father's. #line:ch02_beach_008
    <<set $ch02_rhen_named_lantern = true>>
    Asha [tender]: Then it's a good thing the sea gave you both back. #line:ch02_beach_009
-> Good trade. Don't ask what I gave for it. #line:ch02_beach_010
    Asha [soft_smile]: Then I won't ask. Not today. #line:ch02_beach_011
@camera H05 blend=0.0
@anim rhen sit_up
Rhen [worried]: Rhen Sallow. Oruvel, the raft-town, east of here, all those ugly hulls tied together. Is it still there? #line:ch02_beach_012
@anim toma lower_spear
@wait 1.0
Toma [sad]: We watched the storm go east last night. I am sorry. #line:ch02_beach_013
@camera H06 blend=0.0
@vfx glimmer_held at=rhen_shallows count=9 drift=down_seaward
@wait 1.5
Rhen [surprised]: The water's thick this morning. #line:ch02_beach_018
Rhen [grief]: Those are ours. Aren't they. #line:ch02_beach_019
Asha [sad]: Some of them came in with you. I heard them on the water before it was light. #line:ch02_beach_020
Toma [sad]: She woke the house before light. We came down so they would not come ashore alone. #line:ch02_beach_021
-> Stay with them a minute. #line:ch02_beach_022
    <<set $ch02_rhen_stayed_with_dead = true>>
    @anim rhen sit_in_shallows
    // She is already kneeling beside him: she turns to him where she kneels (a walk would stand her up).
    @anim asha look_at rhen
    @wait 2.5
    Rhen [grief]: Mother Kell can't swim. Never learned. Said the sea owed her a favour. #line:ch02_beach_023
    Asha [tender]: You don't have to be anything yet. Not on this beach. #line:ch02_beach_024
    @anim toma palms_level
    Toma [sad]: Be level, Oruvel. #line:ch02_beach_025
    // He is still sitting in the water: H05 at his sitting eye-line, and her hand to help him up.
    @camera H05 blend=0.0
    @anim asha offer_hand
-> Don't look at them. Get up. #line:ch02_beach_026
    @anim rhen turn_from_sea
    @anim rhen stand_unsteady
    Rhen [afraid]: No. Up. I'm getting up. The beach is moving, but I'm getting up. #line:ch02_beach_027
    @anim toma catch_rhen
    Toma [neutral]: Slowly. #line:ch02_beach_028
    Asha [worried]: Lean on him. He likes it, he just won't say so. #line:ch02_beach_029
    // He is standing, leaning on Toma (decisions_log N-17): H05 follows his eye to standing height,
    // Asha rises to meet it, and there is no offered hand. He is already up.
    @anim asha rise_to_stand
    // Let her finish rising before H05 opens: haluna.md H05 has her already standing.
    @wait 0.8
    // H05 is the kneeling height: once they are up, H05_up is the standing two-shot along the beach.
    @camera H05_up blend=0.0
Asha [soft_smile]: I'm Asha. And that's Toma. #line:ch02_beach_030
<<if $ch02_rhen_stayed_with_dead>>
    // Stay branch (decisions_log N-19, N-22): he takes the hand she offered as soon as she has
    // named herself, so she isn't holding it out through Toma's introduction. They rise together,
    // and H05 (Rhen's POV, haluna.md H05) rises with his eye.
    // M2-FP-119: the cut to the standing two-shot comes first, so they rise in it. Kept on H05 (the kneeling height),
    // the rise filled the frame with his legs at the lens for 1.2 s.
    @camera H05_up blend=0.0
    @anim rhen take_hand asha
    @anim rhen rise_to_stand
    @anim asha rise_to_stand
    @wait 1.2
<<endif>>
Toma [neutral]: Toma Okeru, of Haluna. You are speaking to the Lady— #line:ch02_beach_031
Asha [tender]: To Asha. Who is glad you're here. #line:ch02_beach_032
Rhen [surprised]: Lady what? #line:ch02_beach_033
@face asha soft_smile 0.3
Asha [soft_smile]: Later. You're shaking. #line:ch02_beach_034
<<if $ch02_rhen_named_lantern>>
    Asha [tender]: Come up to the village. Bring your father's light. You'll eat first, and then we'll tell you what we know. #line:ch02_beach_014
<<else>>
    Asha [tender]: Come up to the village. You'll eat first, and then we'll tell you what we know. #line:ch02_beach_015
<<endif>>
@camera H01 blend=0.0 grade=ch02
@mark asha beach_path walk
@mark toma beach_path walk
@mark rhen beach_path walk
She smiled first. Every time. It took me a long while to understand why. #line:ch02_beach_035 #vo
<<set $ch02_met_asha = true>>
@fade out 1.5
@letterbox off
<<event zone_unlock haluna_village>>
===
